<title>NEW ZEALAND: New, ex-o/seas NZ vehicle regs fall in November.</title>
<headline>New, ex-o/seas NZ vehicle regs fall in November.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>New and ex-overseas vehicle registrations fell to 20,927 in November from 21,061 in October, the Land Transport and Safety Authority said on Thursday.</p>
<p>They were up from 18,157 in November 1995.</p>
<p>In total, 22,870 vehicles were registered in November, up from 20,177 a year ago.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64-4-4734746)</p>
